spice
* SPICE Netlist for Transistor Amplifier Circuit

* Voltage Source
Vsig 3 0 DC 0 AC 1

* Resistors
Rsig 3 5  R_sig_value
Rb 5 6   R_b_value
Re 2 8   R_e_value
Rl 2 7   R_l_value

* Capacitors
Cc1 5 4  C_c1_value
Cc2 2 7  C_c2_value

* Transistor
Q1 4 5 2 npn

* Power Supplies
Vcc 4 0 DC V_cc_value
Vee 8 0 DC -V_ee_value

.END